# This repo is edited on Windows and runs on a Raspberry Pi. Everything textual is stored
# and checked out with LF, because CRLF is not cosmetic here:
#
#   - a shell script with CRLF fails on the Pi with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M"
#   - a systemd unit with CRLF has trailing ^M inside ExecStart
#   - .desktop entries are parsed strictly enough to care
#
# The two boxes drifting apart on line endings is exactly the class of problem docs/PI.md
# already warns about for install procedures.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched, never diffed as text.
*.onnx      binary
*.wav       binary
*.png       binary
*.pdf       binary
*.ipynb     binary
